* DFHTCT: hand-written fixture (#5154), syntax per IBM CICS TS for OS/390 R3 Resource Definition Guide SC33-1684-30
* ch.13 p.437-475 (TYPE=INITIAL, TYPE=REGION, TYPE=TERMINAL, TYPE=REMOTE), CICS TS for VSE/ESA R1 Resource Definition
* Guide SC33-1653-05 ch.33 p.297 (TYPE=GPENTRY), and CICS TS 5.4 DFHTCT TYPE=REMOTE. No IBM table text reproduced.
DFHTCT   CSECT
         DFHTCT TYPE=INITIAL,SUFFIX=01,SYSIDNT=HOME,ACCMETH=VTAM
         DFHTCT TYPE=SYSTEM,SYSIDNT=SYSB,ACCMETH=IRC
TERM1    DFHTCT TYPE=TERMINAL,TRMIDNT=T001,ACCMETH=VTAM,TRMTYPE=3270
         DFHTCT TYPE=REGION,SYSIDNT=SYSB
         DFHTCT TYPE=TERMINAL,TRMIDNT=T002,ACCMETH=VTAM,TRMTYPE=3270
         DFHTCT TYPE=REGION,SYSIDNT=LOCAL
         DFHTCT TYPE=GPENTRY,TRMIDNT=SEQ1,GPBLKSZ=(80,80),             X
               GPTYPE=(2540,1403),LININL=80
         DFHTCT TYPE=REMOTE,SYSIDNT=SYSB,TRMIDNT=R001,TRMTYPE=3270,     X
               RMTNAME=RR01
         DFHTCT TYPE=LINE,ACCMETH=VTAM
         DFHTCT TYPE=FINAL
         END
